    "app.prot.seguir": "Back to the app",
    "app.priv.cuenta.t": "Your account",
    "app.priv.cuenta.c": "The account is <b>optional</b>: without one you see everything and report anonymously. If you create one, we store your <b>first and last names</b>, your <b>ID number (cédula)</b>, your <b>email</b>, your password (encrypted, nobody can read it) and, if you add it, your <b>photo</b>. Only the risk team sees this data and it is never published with your reports; with an account you can still send a report anonymously. The session lives in a technical server cookie (not a tracking one) that expires after 30 days without use. You can change your photo, fix your name or email, sign out or <b>delete your account</b> at any time from «My account», top right: your data and photo are erased and your reports stay without an author. ",
